  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation assessed the results of Diakonia&apos;s regional program for Latin America. Diakonia is a key actor in the area, and employs methods of work (seminars, capacity training) that are fairly typical of the area of support.The Institute for Latin American Studies at the University of Stockholm co-ordinated a longitudinal study of a selection of eight projects supported by Diakonia in Latin America.</narrative>
